[00:00.00] 作词 : Andrew Jackson/Duck Blackwell/Teddy Swims
[00:00.00][by:桃桃白茶]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Andrew Jackson/Duck Blackwell/Teddy Swims
[00:09.16]Used to believe Heaven was bulletproof
[00:09.16]我曾深信天堂坚不可摧
[00:13.32]Only God can turn a red light blue
[00:13.32]只有上帝能让红灯变蓝
[00:18.05]Been cutting me deep, dying to talk to you
[00:18.05]即便心如刀割，也渴求与你交谈
[00:21.95]Only love can push the blade right through
[00:21.95]只有爱能使利刃刺穿
[00:25.74]This love's an orphan calling on deaf ears
[00:25.74]这份爱像孤儿的呼唤置若罔闻
[00:30.01]And there's no after life, but if there is
[00:30.01]那儿没有来生，但如果有的话
[00:34.60]It's late in the night time, so it's the right time
[00:34.60]夜深人静正当时
[00:39.08]For sleep talking, sleep talking
[00:39.08]去呓语，呓语
[00:43.31]Now the heart's shot dead
[00:43.31]我的心现已被处决
[00:45.88]Buried under each and every word unsaid
[00:45.88]埋葬在每一句未曾启齿的话里
[00:50.63]24 hours since ‘Goodbye, God bless’
[00:50.63]“再见，上帝保佑”的24小时后
[00:54.60]'Fore we let the ghost get away
[00:54.60]在我们让魂魄逃散前
[00:59.67]One last communion, babe
[00:59.67]最后一次交流，宝贝
[01:10.11]So I let it go with nobody else around
[01:10.11]所以我在四下无人的时候选择罢休
[01:14.46]Couldn't watch forever fall face down
[01:14.46]不能眼睁睁看着一切永远面朝下栽倒
[01:18.47]So I turned my head the second it hit the ground
[01:18.47]所以我在触地的一瞬间别过了头
[01:22.65]And I felt it, but it made no sound
[01:22.65]我感觉到了，可它却寂然无声
[01:26.80]This love's an orphan calling on deaf ears
[01:26.80]这份爱像孤儿的呼唤置若罔闻
[01:31.39]And there's no afterlife, but if there is
[01:31.39]那儿没有来生，但如果有的话
[01:35.68]It's late in the night time, so it's the right time
[01:35.68]夜深人静正当时
[01:39.99]For sleep talking, sleep talking
[01:39.99]去呓语，呓语
[01:44.28]It was a grand old age
[01:44.28]那已是长生久视
[01:46.91]Oh, yes, I know that nothing gold can stay
[01:46.91]哦，是的，我知道韶华易逝
[01:51.79]But I couldn't bring myself to turn that page
[01:51.79]但我无法让自己翻篇开始
[01:55.59]Before I dropped a kiss on the grave
[01:55.59]在我向坟墓落下那一吻前
[02:00.43]One last communion, babe
[02:00.43]最后一次交流，宝贝
[02:09.18]One last communion, babe
[02:09.18]最后一次交流，宝贝
[02:12.82]One last, one last, one last
[02:12.82]最后一次，最后一次，最后一次
[02:27.14]One last communion, babe
[02:27.14]最后一次交流，宝贝
[02:36.78]It was a childish game
[02:36.78]这是一个幼稚的游戏
[02:39.34]Who can light a candle in the crying rain?
[02:39.34]谁能在哭泣的雨中点亮烛光？
[02:43.89]No one could know about the mess we've made
[02:43.89]没有人能知道我们造成的混乱
[02:48.03]I'm scrubbing, praying that the blood don't stain
